<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sasol lifts first half earnings, dividend.</title>
<headline>Sasol lifts first half earnings, dividend.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 25, 1996 (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     207.7	 vs     174.1</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  65.0	 vs	53.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1,254	 vs     1,025</p>
<p>    Operating profit	1,989	 vs    1,579</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2,139	 vs    1,728</p>
<p>    Tax			   842	 vs	609</p>
<p>    Interest received	 148	 vs	147</p>
<p>    Turnover		  7,895	 vs    6,756</p>
<p>Contribution to operating profit by division:</p>
<p>    - Mining		    157	 vs	148</p>
<p>    - Synfuels		  866	 vs	691</p>
<p>    - Chemicals		 648	 vs	498</p>
<p>    - Oil			 341	 vs	266</p>
<p>    - Other		     (23)	vs	(24)</p>
<p>Div payable April 16</p>
<p>on register March 14</p>
<p>Full name: Sasol Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
